 L("Anna: What's in your bag?|Leo: My lunch and a book.", "What is in Leo's bag?", "food and a book", ["a book and a ball", "his lunch and a pen", "only a book"], "'My lunch and a book.' Lunch is food.", ["A ball wasn't said.", "A pen wasn't said.", "His lunch is there too."]),
